# The API image is built from the repository root (infra/docker/api.Dockerfile). Nothing secret and nothing it does
# not need may reach the build: no .env files, no installed packages, no build output, no audio, no phone app.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-tools
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
.git
.claude
apps/mobile
services
spike
docs
infra/ngrok
